            "review_title": "Review at The Bar Hikasa Mixology",
            "review_text": "健国 金\n2 contributions\n0\nIt is highly recommended. The location is great, the staff are friendly and the atmosphere is great.\nJul 2025 • Friends\nA bar with a particularly good atmosphere. The staff were Japanese and Vietnamese, everyone was friendly and very chatty. Japanese, Vietnamese, English can all be exchanged. The location is also very bustling and there are many restaurants nearby. It is highly recommended if you want to find an ambience bar and friends to talk to after dinner and have a drink!\nRead more\nTranslated from Chinese\nShow original\nWritten January 9, 2026\nGo02446408105\nThank you for your kind review!\nWe’re very happy to hear that you enjoyed your time at our bar.\n\nYour feedback means a lot to us, and we look forward to welcoming you again soon at The Bar Hikasa! 🍸\nRead more\nWritten April 1, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
